## What is upstream-derived and what is ours

Upstream in origin (structure, task definitions, download and preprocessing
conventions, evaluation scaffolding):

    pipelines/

Written for this project, but kept here because it is tightly coupled to the
upstream layout and imports it:

    augment_process_result_v11_update/

The SADA and skill-off augmentation, target hiding and re-attachment, the
five-fold XGBoost evaluation, the Skrub embedding, the per-fold SHAP top-64
selection and the result-summarisation code are this project's contribution.

Full provenance statement: `../../THIRD_PARTY.md` and
`../../5_reference/configs/upstream_sources.json`.
